WEBVTT

01:30.440 --> 01:34.950
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.200 --> 01:37.910
[Episode 38]

01:45.200 --> 01:46.330
The illusion beast.

01:46.990 --> 01:47.630
The illusion beast.

01:47.630 --> 01:49.759
No wonder Long Zhi failed her tribulation.

01:49.759 --> 01:52.430
She lost the protection
of the Dragon Essence Pearl.

01:52.430 --> 01:52.920
How...

01:53.350 --> 01:53.840
How...

01:54.070 --> 01:55.590
How could this happen?

01:58.640 --> 01:59.900
How did it come to this?

02:01.760 --> 02:03.620
The Treasure House has a barrier.

02:03.680 --> 02:05.370
Only dragons can enter.

02:05.870 --> 02:08.310
The Dragon Essence Pearl
is a sacred dragon relic.

02:08.310 --> 02:10.960
Only those with dragon scales can open it.

02:11.560 --> 02:13.760
Who switched the Dragon Essence Pearl?

02:20.960 --> 02:21.510
Long Yu.

02:23.470 --> 02:25.000
Do you have anything to say?

02:25.390 --> 02:25.990
A...

02:29.000 --> 02:30.840
A few days ago,

02:31.030 --> 02:34.760
I took Hong Ye to the Treasure House
to see the Dragon Essence Pearl.

02:35.240 --> 02:36.079
But I swear,

02:36.750 --> 02:37.880
we just looked at it.

02:38.360 --> 02:39.820
Really. It was just a look.

02:40.680 --> 02:41.750
I have no idea

02:41.910 --> 02:44.030
how the Pearl was switched.

02:44.030 --> 02:44.840
I knew it.

02:45.030 --> 02:46.400
Hong Ye was definitely up to no good

02:46.400 --> 02:48.079
trying to get close to Dragon Lord.

02:48.079 --> 02:49.960
This little dragon
has caused such disaster.

02:49.960 --> 02:51.750
He should be banished from our clan!

02:51.750 --> 02:52.200
Yes,

02:52.240 --> 02:53.079
banish him!

02:53.110 --> 02:54.640
What I'm saying is all true.

02:55.470 --> 02:56.430
Hong Ye said

02:56.430 --> 02:59.490
he wanted to prepare
a wedding gift for the Dragon Lord.

02:59.800 --> 03:01.630
That's why I agreed to show him.

03:02.000 --> 03:02.630
You...

03:03.160 --> 03:04.870
Long Yu, how could you do this?

03:04.870 --> 03:07.530
I'll go find Hong Ye
and get to the bottom of this.

03:10.680 --> 03:11.470
Sister.

03:12.870 --> 03:14.690
If this is what you want,

03:15.120 --> 03:15.960
I accept it.

03:16.870 --> 03:18.870
But please look back at me once more.

03:21.470 --> 03:22.240
Xiao Yao.

03:22.840 --> 03:24.030
As an Azure Dragon,

03:24.710 --> 03:26.510
your power has reached its peak.

03:27.280 --> 03:30.280
Why do you still want to
exterminate all other demons?

03:31.000 --> 03:33.100
Is it to avenge Hong Ye?

03:49.120 --> 03:49.960
Yes.

03:52.750 --> 03:54.020
Hong Ye!

03:54.400 --> 03:56.540
When you were slaughtering humans,

03:57.360 --> 03:59.620
did you ever imagine this day would come?

04:00.720 --> 04:01.710
You once said,

04:03.030 --> 04:03.890
either endure,

04:05.590 --> 04:06.750
or be ruthless.

04:07.480 --> 04:08.390
Either endure,

04:09.590 --> 04:10.900
or be ruthless,

04:11.870 --> 04:13.330
so you can stand firm.

04:13.590 --> 04:15.320
For tens of thousands of years,

04:16.560 --> 04:19.160
humans have suffered
under demon oppression.

04:19.510 --> 04:20.950
Unlike humans,

04:21.190 --> 04:23.850
you've enjoyed all the best
of heaven and earth,

04:24.190 --> 04:25.940
with nearly immortal lives.

04:27.560 --> 04:28.630
But from today,

04:29.310 --> 04:31.370
humans will no longer need to endure.

04:32.920 --> 04:34.430
With the Yuli Spring,

04:36.000 --> 04:37.540
it is now humans' turn

04:39.440 --> 04:41.480
to hold dominion over this world.

04:55.950 --> 04:58.190
Xiao Yao gave everything for you.

04:58.510 --> 04:59.310
She loved you,

05:00.090 --> 05:01.100
protected you,

05:02.000 --> 05:04.480
and defied her own kind to marry you—

05:05.510 --> 05:06.360
yet in the end,

05:06.600 --> 05:08.250
you merely used her!

05:08.510 --> 05:10.710
How do you face her again?

05:14.610 --> 05:15.420
[Happiness]

05:28.120 --> 05:29.000
Xiao Yao...

05:30.630 --> 05:32.230
will surely forgive me.

05:34.890 --> 05:36.340
Everything I've done

05:37.200 --> 05:39.630
was so we could be together forever.

05:53.960 --> 05:55.159
[Happiness]

06:23.560 --> 06:24.350
Ao Hen.

06:43.310 --> 06:44.040
Xiao Yao.

07:05.670 --> 07:06.700
The Yuli Spring

07:09.240 --> 07:10.510
has finally appeared.

07:17.310 --> 07:18.160
So,

07:19.950 --> 07:21.680
was everything—our marriage,

07:22.630 --> 07:24.560
having me try on the wedding robes—

07:25.430 --> 07:27.480
all part of your plan?

07:31.120 --> 07:32.050
That's not true.

07:32.530 --> 07:34.120
You also pretended to be Ao Hen

07:34.120 --> 07:35.560
and slaughtered the demons,

07:35.560 --> 07:36.120
right?

07:37.800 --> 07:39.430
Switching the Dragon Essence Pearl,

07:39.430 --> 07:41.159
using the illusion beast
to impersonate me,

07:41.159 --> 07:42.430
and tricking them out of their pearls—

07:42.430 --> 07:44.030
you did all that, didn't you?

07:59.270 --> 08:01.910
Protecting humans is my duty,

08:03.790 --> 08:05.220
but falling in love with you

08:05.220 --> 08:06.510
was instinct.

08:09.750 --> 08:11.410
When I left the Dragon Palace,

08:12.630 --> 08:13.160
I realized

08:13.160 --> 08:15.220
I had already fallen in love with you.

08:15.830 --> 08:17.290
I thought about giving up.

08:21.680 --> 08:22.830
In Ao Hen's cave,

08:23.980 --> 08:25.220
even when I was dying,

08:25.630 --> 08:27.160
I still couldn't let you go.

08:29.120 --> 08:30.160
At that moment, I realized

08:30.160 --> 08:31.630
how insignificant I was.

08:34.640 --> 08:36.480
I had no power to protect humans,

08:37.320 --> 08:38.510
and I didn't even deserve

08:38.510 --> 08:40.330
to stand before the one I love.

08:43.500 --> 08:44.080
Yes.

08:45.200 --> 08:46.670
I did all those things.

08:50.750 --> 08:52.560
I have to obtain the Yuli Spring

08:53.090 --> 08:54.810
to be with you forever.

08:55.790 --> 08:56.480
Otherwise,

08:57.550 --> 08:59.550
I would have to watch helplessly...

09:00.190 --> 09:01.620
watch my people

09:02.910 --> 09:06.790
being trampled by demons again and again.

09:22.560 --> 09:23.500
Xiao Yao.

09:24.670 --> 09:26.760
Now I've finally defeated all the demons

09:26.760 --> 09:28.160
and can stand before you.

09:31.960 --> 09:32.600
Look.

09:33.520 --> 09:35.250
The Yuli Spring is right ahead.

09:35.870 --> 09:37.470
If we take this step,

09:39.730 --> 09:42.060
I can protect the world together with you.

09:44.240 --> 09:46.700
I want to watch sunrises
and sunsets with you

09:46.930 --> 09:48.260
for thousands of years,

09:48.510 --> 09:50.040
tens of thousands of years,

09:50.670 --> 09:52.070
never leaving your side.

10:10.580 --> 10:15.360
[Happiness]

13:03.710 --> 13:04.500
Xiao Yao.

13:07.300 --> 13:09.810
I can finally truly stand by your side.

13:14.280 --> 13:16.270
It seemed just one step away,

13:19.160 --> 13:20.510
but it took so long,

13:22.640 --> 13:23.440
so, so, long.

14:01.780 --> 14:04.040
Immortality gained at the cost of lives,

14:05.550 --> 14:07.280
does it truly bring happiness?

14:12.440 --> 14:14.240
You speak of humans as innocent—

14:16.270 --> 14:17.730
but what about the demons?

14:37.960 --> 14:39.400
♪ I still remember the light ♪

14:40.170 --> 14:42.050
♪ In your eyes that night ♪

14:44.890 --> 14:46.710
♪ It lit up all the most beautiful lies ♪

14:47.300 --> 14:49.290
♪ I've ever seen ♪

14:50.280 --> 14:53.600
♪ The silence and heat of the moonlight ♪

14:54.090 --> 14:56.110
♪ Fall on my shoulder ♪

14:58.320 --> 15:00.030
♪ The galaxy ♪

15:01.070 --> 15:03.050
♪ Flows on my fingers ♪

15:04.010 --> 15:07.640
♪ Those unrevealed wishes ♪

15:09.180 --> 15:13.740
♪ My heartbeat is hiding,
only the wind is shaking ♪

15:15.080 --> 15:18.220
♪ The stars fall into the sea ♪

15:19.420 --> 15:22.090
♪ Light up the light in your eyes ♪

15:22.810 --> 15:24.030
♪ The lies at this moment ♪

15:24.740 --> 15:28.210
♪ Are so beautiful it's ridiculous ♪

15:29.240 --> 15:32.140
♪ The youth is endless ♪

15:32.990 --> 15:34.070
Why didn't you dodge?

15:33.000 --> 15:35.530
♪ Love grows in time ♪

15:36.710 --> 15:43.830
♪ You are the old wound in my palm ♪

15:37.110 --> 15:38.530
If you want me dead,

15:40.970 --> 15:42.490
then I'll die.

15:46.830 --> 15:48.120
Why should I dodge?

16:00.130 --> 16:01.850
I owe you a life,

16:04.290 --> 16:05.950
and I will repay it.

16:08.030 --> 16:09.030
It's just that...

16:11.920 --> 16:13.500
I won't be around anymore.

16:12.040 --> 16:13.440
♪ We stare at each other ♪

16:14.280 --> 16:16.110
♪ And forget how long it has been ♪

16:16.790 --> 16:18.690
Your friends won't be either.

16:18.890 --> 16:20.710
♪ All I want is this moment's bloom ♪

16:21.420 --> 16:23.380
♪ Grow freely ♪

16:24.250 --> 16:27.510
♪ The stars in your eyes
are the only place ♪

16:25.240 --> 16:27.490
In the millions of years to come,

16:28.240 --> 16:30.100
♪ In the distance that I can see ♪

16:31.390 --> 16:33.130
if you ever feel lonely,

16:32.570 --> 16:33.930
♪ Don't think about ♪

16:34.620 --> 16:37.040
♪ Whether we end in a farewell or not ♪

16:36.550 --> 16:37.170
what...

16:38.210 --> 16:41.480
♪ Those unrevealed wishes ♪

16:39.650 --> 16:41.960
what would you do...

16:43.060 --> 16:47.620
♪ My heartbeat is hiding,
only the wind is shaking ♪

16:49.520 --> 16:52.710
♪ The stars fall into the sea ♪

16:53.530 --> 16:56.080
♪ Light up the light in your eyes ♪

16:54.830 --> 16:55.930
Hong Ye.

16:56.910 --> 16:58.130
♪ The lies at this moment ♪

16:58.750 --> 17:02.250
♪ Are so beautiful it's ridiculous ♪

17:00.670 --> 17:01.870
Sorry.

17:03.180 --> 17:06.310
♪ The youth is endless ♪

17:05.710 --> 17:07.950
But this debt you owe

17:06.980 --> 17:09.589
♪ Love grows in time ♪

17:10.730 --> 17:17.920
♪ You are the old wound in my palm ♪

17:11.569 --> 17:13.329
must be repaid.

17:40.870 --> 17:42.930
Look everyone, it's the Dragon Lord!

17:53.520 --> 17:54.490
Dragon Lord.

17:55.770 --> 17:56.240
Is...

17:56.420 --> 17:57.800
Is this the Yuli Spring?

17:57.960 --> 17:58.830
The Yuli Spring?

17:58.830 --> 17:59.790
The Yuli Spring?

19:01.730 --> 19:02.990
The eight pearls

19:03.790 --> 19:05.720
were originally demon treasures.

19:07.000 --> 19:09.190
Tainted with human desires,

19:09.380 --> 19:11.490
these desires gathered together,

19:12.530 --> 19:14.190
and have taken physical form.

19:15.070 --> 19:17.210
My power can only fragment them.

19:18.120 --> 19:20.050
These scattered mirror fragments

19:20.350 --> 19:23.700
contain all the suffering and resentment
of this world.

19:25.310 --> 19:27.120
When they are merged again,

19:27.970 --> 19:30.330
chaos will descend once again.

19:33.270 --> 19:34.930
You must use all your strength

19:36.680 --> 19:38.680
to prevent them from merging again.

19:39.160 --> 19:41.350
At the Dragon Lord's command!

20:05.110 --> 20:05.840
Dragon Lord,

20:06.770 --> 20:08.030
even if you pour
all your strength into it,

20:08.030 --> 20:09.880
you cannot bring him back to life.

20:09.880 --> 20:11.140
Why torment yourself?

20:11.680 --> 20:13.240
He may not return to life,

20:14.810 --> 20:18.140
but he will not fall
into the cycle of reincarnation either.

20:18.310 --> 20:19.790
The Azure Dragon's power

20:20.750 --> 20:22.610
can let him sleep for 5,000 years.

20:23.880 --> 20:25.110
When he awakens,

20:26.510 --> 20:28.400
no human memories will remain.

20:32.000 --> 20:32.830
Let him

20:34.270 --> 20:36.230
atone to the demons.

20:45.030 --> 20:45.920
Hong Ye,

20:46.730 --> 20:48.050
you will not die.

20:50.920 --> 20:52.110
If you die,

20:53.790 --> 20:55.450
I will never be able to return.

20:58.550 --> 20:59.990
Our destinies

21:03.640 --> 21:05.510
are bound together forever.

21:08.010 --> 21:09.540
Rest assured, Dragon Lord.

21:09.880 --> 21:11.310
I will cultivate here,

21:11.330 --> 21:12.390
protecting Hong Ye

21:13.440 --> 21:14.550
until he awakens.

21:25.160 --> 21:26.750
Thank you, Long Yu.

21:28.160 --> 21:30.180
But I need you to do three things.

21:30.400 --> 21:32.330
Even if it were thousands of tasks,

21:32.430 --> 21:33.750
I am at your command.

21:34.970 --> 21:36.340
You are pure-hearted

21:36.960 --> 21:38.220
and without ambition.

21:38.920 --> 21:40.000
First,

21:40.880 --> 21:42.810
I want you to cultivate diligently

21:42.890 --> 21:44.950
and become the Monarch of All Demons.

21:45.420 --> 21:46.620
How is that possible?

21:47.050 --> 21:49.090
The demon race has suffered a catastrophe,

21:49.090 --> 21:50.960
and their strength is greatly diminished.

21:50.960 --> 21:53.070
They need a leader with profound power

21:53.070 --> 21:54.640
and upright character

21:55.030 --> 21:56.920
to guide them in rebuilding.

21:58.400 --> 21:59.440
I didn't do well.

22:00.510 --> 22:01.570
I shall entrust you

22:02.320 --> 22:03.780
with this important task.

22:04.530 --> 22:05.320
I...

22:05.830 --> 22:07.240
I cannot promise,

22:07.830 --> 22:09.030
but I will try my best.

22:13.790 --> 22:14.830
Second,

22:15.790 --> 22:18.190
Ao Hen, Qiong Qi, and Teng She

22:18.640 --> 22:20.700
have been sealed off by human arrays.

22:20.830 --> 22:22.690
I want you to find suitable demons

22:23.550 --> 22:24.920
to protect them well.

22:26.510 --> 22:28.110
I have failed them.

22:28.640 --> 22:29.640
At your command.

22:29.940 --> 22:31.800
I will definitely accomplish it.

22:32.270 --> 22:33.440
Third,

22:35.240 --> 22:36.970
remove me from the dragon clan.

22:38.540 --> 22:39.370
In this world,

22:39.960 --> 22:42.360
there will be no more
Azure Dragon Xiao Yao.

22:42.920 --> 22:43.870
Dragon Lord...

22:44.200 --> 22:46.440
Today's outcome is all my fault.

22:47.350 --> 22:49.410
I don't deserve to be an Azure Dragon,

22:50.200 --> 22:52.060
nor to be remembered by everyone.

22:58.590 --> 22:59.400
Promise me.

23:01.400 --> 23:02.000
Yes.

24:03.270 --> 24:04.480
Dragon Lord!

24:06.750 --> 24:08.070
Dragon Lord!

24:08.880 --> 24:10.460
Dragon Lord!

24:10.720 --> 24:12.200
I didn't let you go back

24:12.220 --> 24:14.790
because you couldn't bear the truth.

24:15.720 --> 24:17.270
For the past ten thousand years,

24:17.270 --> 24:19.720
this world has not known lasting peace

24:19.720 --> 24:21.440
despite your sacrifice.

24:22.480 --> 24:24.910
The temptation of the Yuli Spring
is too great.

24:24.910 --> 24:27.240
The mirror fragments separate and merge—

24:27.720 --> 24:31.320
the wars between humans and demons
have grown ever more frequent.

24:31.320 --> 24:34.630
Qiong Qi, Ao Hen, and Teng She,

24:34.770 --> 24:36.300
have all been resurrected.

24:36.750 --> 24:38.810
What will you choose to do now?

24:41.130 --> 24:44.260
If I can't figure it out,
I'll just not think about it now.

24:45.140 --> 24:48.250
Past and present lives
are cause and effect of each other.

24:48.250 --> 24:50.110
When you open your eyes again,

24:50.320 --> 24:53.750
you will face a world plunged
into chaos once more.

26:18.920 --> 26:19.750
Finally...

26:22.470 --> 26:23.830
You're awake.

26:33.520 --> 26:34.890
Why are you so sad?

26:40.880 --> 26:42.680
I'm not sad.

26:44.420 --> 26:46.150
I'm happy.

26:52.600 --> 26:53.720
Where is this?

26:54.640 --> 26:56.110
The Demons' Valley.

26:59.750 --> 27:01.270
The Demons' Valley?

27:06.550 --> 27:07.480
Who are you?

27:15.200 --> 27:16.440
I am your

27:19.680 --> 27:20.740
old friend,

27:22.350 --> 27:23.270
Long Yu.

27:24.640 --> 27:26.000
My old friend?

27:31.440 --> 27:32.240
What about me?

27:33.200 --> 27:33.920
Who am I?

27:37.240 --> 27:38.570
You are Hong Ye.

28:58.180 --> 28:59.050
Xiao Yao.

29:50.520 --> 29:51.510
I'm sorry.

29:52.350 --> 29:54.350
Hong Ye and I have let everyone down.

29:58.920 --> 30:00.450
You already know the truth.

30:01.060 --> 30:02.590
Why do you still choose him?

30:03.310 --> 30:05.240
Despite all of Hong Ye's mistakes,

30:06.010 --> 30:07.750
he is my husband.

30:08.520 --> 30:09.890
He was 10,000 years ago,

30:10.000 --> 30:12.480
and he still is,10,000 years later.

30:15.680 --> 30:17.590
Hong Ye did harm the demons,

30:17.680 --> 30:19.120
and deceived you all.

30:20.140 --> 30:22.550
But you also slaughtered humans.

30:23.530 --> 30:25.590
This cycle of revenge will never end.

30:26.600 --> 30:27.930
Ten thousand years ago,

30:28.400 --> 30:29.860
after I learned the truth,

30:32.230 --> 30:34.090
I killed Hong Ye with my own hands.

30:40.000 --> 30:41.400
Five thousand years ago,

30:41.730 --> 30:43.580
he awakened as a demon,

30:44.110 --> 30:45.770
with no memory of being human.

30:46.070 --> 30:47.400
For thousands of years,

30:47.580 --> 30:49.380
he has been serving the demons.

30:49.880 --> 30:51.160
Perhaps by fate,

30:51.350 --> 30:53.110
he has been repaying his debt.

31:06.060 --> 31:07.860
Thank you for accompanying me.

31:08.500 --> 31:10.430
You will always be my good brother.

31:11.200 --> 31:13.000
Ten thousand years have passed,

31:13.630 --> 31:15.630
and I can still only be your brother?

31:23.870 --> 31:24.780
Never mind.

31:25.790 --> 31:26.680
I promised you

31:27.420 --> 31:30.480
I would never force you
to do anything you don't want to.

31:34.150 --> 31:34.940
Teng She.

31:41.680 --> 31:43.480
Whenever I feel depressed,

31:44.060 --> 31:45.710
you always cheer me up.

31:46.100 --> 31:47.230
You'd drink with me,

31:47.610 --> 31:49.270
and think of me in everything.

31:49.910 --> 31:51.450
We are the world's

31:52.340 --> 31:53.450
closest siblings.

32:00.940 --> 32:02.330
If you hadn't

32:04.480 --> 32:07.120
rescued me from the Chaos Clan,

32:08.590 --> 32:09.450
I would still be

32:10.550 --> 32:12.550
just a little earthworm.

32:13.350 --> 32:15.440
How could I become
the Teng She I am today?

32:15.440 --> 32:17.300
I will forever be grateful to you.

32:18.950 --> 32:20.060
As long as you

32:22.610 --> 32:23.950
can be happy.

32:37.830 --> 32:39.030
I once said

32:40.400 --> 32:41.930
I will respect your choice.

32:42.440 --> 32:43.840
Since you've chosen him,

32:44.680 --> 32:46.810
I will sincerely give you my blessing.

32:47.950 --> 32:49.360
Just as I did

32:50.330 --> 32:51.330
10,000 years ago.

32:53.200 --> 32:55.830
I know you're cold on the outside
but warm inside.

32:55.830 --> 32:57.070
But I still hope

32:57.550 --> 32:59.150
you can stop being too tough.

32:59.370 --> 33:01.720
In this world, besides winning and losing,

33:01.720 --> 33:03.380
there is also true affection.

33:03.770 --> 33:05.170
You will definitely find

33:06.510 --> 33:07.770
that special someone.

33:16.830 --> 33:17.800
Hong Ye and I

33:18.510 --> 33:21.040
thank you for your generosity
and tolerance.

33:21.400 --> 33:23.960
But there's still a major issue

33:23.960 --> 33:25.290
that we need to resolve.

33:25.920 --> 33:27.400
The 8 demon pearls

33:27.630 --> 33:30.030
were later transformed
into mirror fragments

33:30.030 --> 33:31.490
forming the Kunlun Mirror

33:31.680 --> 33:34.010
which can open the gate
to the Yuli Spring.

33:34.240 --> 33:36.070
The Yuli Spring is

33:36.070 --> 33:37.590
the source of all conflicts in this world.

33:37.590 --> 33:39.920
Therefore, we must seal it permanently.

33:40.960 --> 33:41.410
Yes.

33:47.920 --> 33:49.690
To seal the Yuli Spring completely,

33:49.690 --> 33:51.980
we must destroy the Kunlun Mirror.

33:54.670 --> 33:57.400
Take out those four pieces
we already have first.

34:04.310 --> 34:05.910
These four mirror fragments

34:06.750 --> 34:09.550
represent the four obsessions
of the human realm.

34:10.400 --> 34:11.600
Love and Separation.

34:11.800 --> 34:13.000
Lasting Resentment.

34:13.230 --> 34:14.489
Unattainable Desire.

34:14.920 --> 34:16.320
Unresolved Attachment.

34:16.630 --> 34:18.090
The remaining four pieces

34:18.630 --> 34:21.840
represent
Birth, Aging, Sickness, and Death.

34:22.710 --> 34:23.800
Let's split into four groups

34:23.800 --> 34:24.850
to find them—

34:25.230 --> 34:25.889
how's that?

34:32.929 --> 34:34.840
I take your silence as agreement.

34:38.110 --> 34:39.750
I'm still the same as before,

34:40.280 --> 34:41.880
always listening to Sister.

34:45.800 --> 34:48.030
I've always followed your orders.

34:51.110 --> 34:52.190
In that case,

34:52.590 --> 34:53.820
let's make a bet.

34:54.880 --> 34:57.139
Let's see who finds the fragments first.

35:01.070 --> 35:01.550
Come.

35:25.590 --> 35:26.800
Let us

35:27.650 --> 35:29.510
end this chaotic world together.

35:43.670 --> 35:44.150
This...

35:44.440 --> 35:45.960
This is an omen of great disaster!

35:45.960 --> 35:46.590
Meteor.

35:46.940 --> 35:48.510
The disaster star split into four!

35:48.510 --> 35:49.400
We can't win this!

35:49.400 --> 35:51.560
The world will be taken over by demons!

35:51.670 --> 35:52.980
We can't defeat them!

35:53.150 --> 35:54.110
Run!

35:56.150 --> 35:56.670
Run!

35:59.800 --> 36:00.320
Hurry!

36:06.590 --> 36:07.510
Ridiculous!

36:20.250 --> 36:22.380
The demons haven't even attacked yet,

36:22.670 --> 36:24.440
and you're already in disarray.

36:24.440 --> 36:25.920
You're an Imperial Guard—

36:26.790 --> 36:28.440
you lose your dignity just like this?

36:28.440 --> 36:30.050
A mere Feiyu Guard like you

36:30.110 --> 36:33.210
doesn't get to point fingers
at us Imperial Guards.

36:34.030 --> 36:36.360
We are all the Emperor's personal guards.

36:37.000 --> 36:39.370
Drawing your blade
before the Imperial Guard

36:39.370 --> 36:40.830
is equivalent to treason!

36:50.920 --> 36:53.280
This is a matter of life and death.

36:55.270 --> 36:57.770
If anyone else dares to disrupt morale,

37:00.320 --> 37:01.580
they will be executed!

37:03.000 --> 37:04.410
After the battle is over,

37:04.760 --> 37:06.880
you can file complaints
when we return to the capital.

37:06.880 --> 37:07.960
But now,

37:08.010 --> 37:09.550
pick up your weapons

37:09.760 --> 37:11.610
and aim at Demons' Valley!

37:13.400 --> 37:14.660
Where are we going now?

37:15.070 --> 37:15.870
The North Sea.

37:16.000 --> 37:17.400
Is a fragment of the Kunlun Mirror there?

37:17.400 --> 37:18.710
Ten thousand years ago,

37:18.710 --> 37:20.400
the North Sea
was a domain of the dragon clan.

37:20.400 --> 37:22.800
The dragons nurtured
the Dragon Essence Pearl there.

37:22.800 --> 37:25.210
My Master was the last of the dragon clan,

37:25.710 --> 37:27.640
but I never heard him mention this.

37:28.240 --> 37:30.130
Was your Master named Long Yu?

37:31.830 --> 37:33.520
You met him
when you went back 10,000 years ago?

37:33.520 --> 37:34.110
Yes.

37:36.670 --> 37:38.180
I once asked my Master

37:39.030 --> 37:41.080
what the world was like before.

37:41.710 --> 37:43.330
But he always kept it secret.

37:45.980 --> 37:46.820
Xiao Yao.

37:47.360 --> 37:49.620
What exactly happened 10,000 years ago?

37:50.060 --> 37:52.500
That's a very long story.

37:53.870 --> 37:55.200
Are you ready to hear it?

38:02.510 --> 38:02.970
My Lord.

38:03.360 --> 38:04.420
Congratulations.

38:06.550 --> 38:08.710
Given our current situation,

38:09.590 --> 38:11.280
what is there to celebrate?

38:12.070 --> 38:14.470
Congratulations on your increased power.

38:15.000 --> 38:17.820
Now your demon-slaying blade
can not only kill demons,

38:17.820 --> 38:19.130
but humans as well.

38:30.150 --> 38:31.490
In today's world,

38:33.030 --> 38:36.230
have humans and demons
truly become indistinguishable?

38:37.400 --> 38:38.510
It doesn't matter

38:39.820 --> 38:41.550
if it's human or demon anymore.

38:42.230 --> 38:44.670
You don't have much time left.

38:45.150 --> 38:47.440
Those four shooting stars in the sky

38:48.280 --> 38:51.320
were three ancient great demons
and Hong Ye.

38:52.230 --> 38:53.280
They've split up now

38:53.280 --> 38:54.590
with only one purpose.

38:56.110 --> 38:57.170
The Kunlun Mirror.

38:58.110 --> 38:59.880
They're moving so quickly,

39:00.630 --> 39:03.630
I fear they've already located
the mirror fragments.

39:04.840 --> 39:06.900
If they collect all the fragments,

39:09.280 --> 39:11.730
we may never have another chance.

39:12.550 --> 39:14.070
The old demon is right.

39:14.760 --> 39:17.650
They've gone in four directions—
north, south, east, and west.

39:17.650 --> 39:19.650
We can use our numbers against them.

39:20.270 --> 39:22.400
With the full force of the Feiyu Guard,

39:22.510 --> 39:24.110
we can defeat them one by one.

39:25.800 --> 39:27.080
We still have a chance.

39:28.680 --> 39:30.420
Which one should we target first?

39:30.420 --> 39:34.180
[Hong Ye] [Qiong Qi] [Ao Hen] [Teng She]

39:34.630 --> 39:35.840
The closest one.

39:37.360 --> 39:39.420
It has already reached Mount Buchou.

40:20.150 --> 40:21.610
Are there any demons left?

40:22.710 --> 40:24.230
You're too late.

40:26.320 --> 40:29.220
The humans have taken everything
worth taking.

40:29.400 --> 40:31.280
I'm the only one left—

40:32.150 --> 40:34.110
an old demon with no spiritual energy.
